#   * in Start() it reads ZBI platform ID + board info, publishes a "sys" node, and serves
#     fuchsia.hardware.platform.bus/PlatformBus for board drivers to bind;
#   * driver_host_dfv2 dlopens platform-bus.so from pkg/driver_host/lib/.
#
# Boot marker (written by zx_debug_write in Start() before return zx::ok()):
#   CERISE-PLATFORM-BUS-OK
#
# This product is COMPILE-ONLY; runtime boot requires kernel resource routing,
# fuchsia.boot.Items, and fuchsia.system.state.SystemStateTransition which are
# not yet available in our Cerise boot environment.
