# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# driver-host Step 6: PCI bus enumeration gate.
#
# Extends x64-acpi: same root/dm topology; driver_index now indexes BOTH
# platform-bus-x86 (ACPI + pciroot publisher) AND bus-pci (PCI bus enumerator).
# When AcpiPciroot DdkAdd's ZX_PROTOCOL_PCIROOT (= 0x20 = BIND_PROTOCOL.ROOT),
# driver-index matches bus-pci via pci.bind; bus-pci is loaded via the same
# compat.so path as platform-bus-x86. bus-pci.so is staged in driver_host lib/
# so load_compat_module's dlopen("bus-pci.so") resolves via the loader service.
#
# Expected serial markers:
#   CERISE-PLATFORM-BUS-OK    : platform-bus root started (prerequisite)
#   CERISE-ACPI-INIT-OK       : AcpiEnableSubsystem succeeded (ACPICA live)
#   CERISE-PCIROOT-PUBLISHED  : AcpiPciroot DdkAdd'd (ZX_PROTOCOL_PCIROOT)
#   CERISE-PCI-ENUM           : bus-pci bound + first valid PCI device found

# driver_index: ONE binary — the boot-driver list is board data
