# qemu-x64-shutdown: orderly shutdown + poweroff proof product.
# ===========================================================================
# Same lean base as qemu-x64-console-spike/diagnostics (component_framework +
# driver_framework, no netstack3/storage). The root realm is root_dfv2acpi_shutdown:
# the driver base PLUS the builtin shutdown_shim and the shutdown_trigger ELF component.
# Once driver_manager is up, shutdown_trigger calls Admin.Poweroff on the shim, which
# records Poweroff and drives component_manager's reverse-dependency topology teardown
# via SystemController; driver_manager (a dependent of the shim) then issues
# zx_system_powerctl(SHUTDOWN) -> QEMU q35 ACPI poweroff (clean guest exit). Proven by
# //validation:shutdown-boot.

